  "content_html": "<p><br /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/e1f6143c8228fb1fb1.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"הטלה העשירי\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1024\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"320\" src=\"/assets/images/content/e1f6143c8228fb1fb1.png\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><p></p><p></p><div><div dir=\"rtl\"><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">ויקרא פרק כז פסוק לב:</span></h2><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מקרא:</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">וְכָל מַעְשַׂר בָּקָר וָצֹאן</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">כֹּל אֲשֶׁר יַעֲבֹר</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">תַּחַת הַשָּׁבֶט</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">הָעֲשִׂירִי</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">יִהְיֶה קֹּדֶשׁ לה'</span></span></p><!--more--><p></p><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ופירושו:</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כל עשירית מהעגלים ומהטלאים שנולדו השנה,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כל בהמה שתעבור ע\"י בעל העדר המונה את עדרו,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תחת הַמַּטֶּה&nbsp;(הצבוע באדום),</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כל עגל או טלה עשירי,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יוקרב כקרבן (ובשרו ייאכל ע\"י בעל העדר ומכריו)</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></span></h3><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">ויקרא פרק כז</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;פסוק לב:</span></span></h2><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מקרא:</span></h3></div></div><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">לֹא יְבַקֵּר</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בֵּין טוֹב לָרַע</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְלֹא יְמִירֶנּוּ</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְאִם הָמֵר יְמִירֶנּוּ</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְהָיָה הוּא</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּתְמוּרָתוֹ</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יִהְיֶה קֹדֶשׁ</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לֹא יִגָּאֵל</span></p><div><div dir=\"rtl\"><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ופירושו:</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">לא ידקדק בעל העדר לבחור מי יוצא עשירי,</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">בין בהמה שמנה ובריאה לבהמה חולה ובעלת מום,</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">ואחרי שהוקדשה למעשר - לא יַחְלִיפֶנָּה באחרת,</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">ואם יחליף אותה באחרת (ואפילו טובה יותר),</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">והייתה בהמת המעשר המקורית,</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">וגם הבהמה האחרת,</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">שתיהן תוקרבנה למזבח,</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">קרבן מעשר בהמה - לעולם לא יימכר ולא ייפדה.</span></span></p></div></div>"
}
